# Ambient pads keep their original unrolled, sustained block chords.
expect urbanpianorolls 0
spin K2 13
spin K3 1
expect urbansub 1
tap PLAY
wait 7600
expect playing 1
expect urbanpianorolls 0
expect urbanpianonotes 0
shot atmospheric-long-pad-chords.png
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
